 "brief": "URGENT from Brett: console commands from Claude/MCP (console_open, console_show / Follow Amber) keep failing. Seen Nov 11: commands go to a sleeping console client and sit 'pending until the tab wakes'; the console that is actually in front of Brett drops off console.clients (cc-8a4kz2wuqelw: opened Plan Studio, then 'no open console' a minute later); console_show to a specific build only scrolls to the top of the list instead of focusing and highlighting that build row; tab switching (orchestrator Pending tab) can't be targeted. Fix: 1) keep console client connections alive (heartbeat, reconnect, visibilitychange wake), drop dead clients fast, deliver to the most recently active live client, retry, and if no live console answers within a few seconds open the console on the phone via AmberX open_url. 2) console_show/console_open accept a build id or tab (e.g. build-orchestrator pending, a build id) and open that tab, scroll the row into view, expand and highlight it. 3) Return a truthful result (delivered vs pending). Tests for each. Commit, push, PR to the front of the merge queue, redeploy the console after land. AmberX FYI to Brett when fixed. Don't stop to ask.",
